    "previewNotes": "Component snippets represent their named scope. Semantic overrides in Versus samples are local equivalents of its route selector. Fonts are inherited from the vendored sources; fallback stacks remain usable. Tonal ramps are synthesized OKLCH panel aids, not additional shipping color tokens. The cockpit sample contains its DOM status and rules, not a substitute for the procedural 3D viewport; the shipped viewport uses galaxy/duel-scene.js. Former orbital-player preview replaced by the active cockpit pattern."
